$DATUM 8-(3-Cyclopropyl-5-(4-morpholin-4yl-phenyl)pyridin-4-yl)-2,8-diazaspiro[4.5]decan-1-one
(62):
8-(3-Chloro-5-cyclopropylpyridin-4-yl)-2,8-diazaspiro[4.5]decan-1-one 61
(30 mg, 0.098 mmol),
4-(4-(4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolan-2-yl)phenyl)morpholine (43
mg, 0.15 mmol), sodium carbonate (26 mg, 0.25 mmol) and
dichlorobis(tricyclohexylphosphine)- palladium(II) (7.2 mg, 9.8 μmol)
were loaded in a microwave vial under argon and then acetonitrile (750
μL) and water (200 μL) were added. The reaction mixture was heated in the
microwave at 150 °C for 30 min. The solvent was evaporated and the crude
material purified via Biotage column chromatography (DCM/EtOH 98:2 to
90:10) followed by filtration on a SCX-2 column (product was released
using 1 N ammonia solution in methanol). The filtrate was then
concentrated under vacuum. The title compound 62 as a colorless oil (30
mg, 71% yield). 1H NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3) δ 0.79-0.83 (m, 2H), 1.00-1.05
(m, 2H), 1.29-1.35 (m, 2H), 1.89- 2.00 (m, 4H), 2.10-2.17 (m, 1H), 2.70
(t, J = 12.5 Hz, 2H), 3.10-3.16 (m, 2H), 3.20-3.24 (m, 4H), 3.29 (t, J =
6.9 Hz, 2H), 3.87-3.93 (m, 4H), 5.92 (s, 1H), 6.98 (d, J = 8.7, 2H), 7.21
(d, J = 8.7 Hz, 2H), 8.07 (s, 1H), 8.13 (s, 1H); 13C NMR (126 MHz, CDCl3)
δ 8.1, 10.9 , 30.9, 32.5, 38.7, 42.0, 47.7, 49.1, 66.9, 115.1, 130.3,
130.4, 132.4, 133.8, 146.3, 150.35, 150.41, 156.2 , 181.7; LC (Method C)
- MS (ESI, m/z) Rt = 1.85 min – 433 (M+H)+. ESI-HRMS: Found: 433.2590
calculated for C26H33N4O2 (M+H)+: 433.2598.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM microwave irradiation, thermal, microwave vial used, Suzuki coupling
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Discovery of Potent, Orally Bioavailable, Small-Molecule Inhibitors of
WNT Signaling from a Cell-Based Pathway Screen
